text The scene changes.
text An unfamiliar hallway.
text Oh...
text So I was able to get away from that awful place...
text That thought is all it takes to calm me down.
text Nagisa is next to me.
text She's been by my side the whole time.
text I raise my hand to find it wrapped in white bandages.
text I look down toward my legs.
text My pants are sticking to my legs because of all the hardened blood.
text I want to say that Nagisa sees me doing this and thus insists that we need to clean my legs up.
