text I've been acting calm ever since we got back home, but...
text I want to hold Nagisa and break down in tears.
text Nagisa didn't hate my father...
text She was even making him food...
text But it was all for naught because of me...
text Yet Nagisa stayed right by my side the entire time after that, and that's what's nearly driving me to tears.
text I want her to know just how much I regret what I did.
text And then... I want her to comfort me, to tell me that everything's okay now.
text But...
text That would just be me acting spoiled.
text I turn my back in the dark to Nagisa and act like I'm still asleep.
text @[Tomoya]
text (Yeah, I'm just going to keep running away like this... aren't I?)
text I endure the pain alone... and end up getting no sleep.
