text If she's really saying that I only have to meet him once or twice a year...
text I get the feeling I could put up with that.
text And if she sees that as me looking forward positively, then I think it could save me.
text After all... I've never stopped running away all this time.
text I don't want Nagisa to have to see me like that.
text But in the end... It's only because that Nagisa is by my side that I...
