text @[Nagisa]
text Oh... but even if you let go of me now, I don't think I'd be able to focus...
text @[Tomoya]
text Huh? Then what should I do?
setvar strS[1001] = "CGNG31D"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGNG31D.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound N8X.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text I'm going to take a short break...
sound N8Y.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text And I want you to hold me while I do...
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text *Squeeze*
text I squeeze Nagisa's body from behind before my brain can even process what I'm doing.
sound N8Z.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Hold on... please wait...
text As I loosen my grip on her, Nagisa shifts positions in my arms, turning toward me to make herself easier to hug.
text I hold her tight once more.
text I push my body right up against hers as we embrace.
text But we're still sitting. My legs are in an odd position, and they start to hurt.
text So I push Nagisa down to the ground.
text She stretches her legs out too and takes a position right under me.
text My arm is pinned under her back, so I shift it up to cradle her neck.
text Now our bodies have come perfectly together, from head to toe.
text As I hold her even tighter, I rub my face into her neck so much that I think it might bother her.
text She seems to respond in kind, putting more strength into her arms while still wrapped around me.
text @[Tomoya]
text (Yeah... I'm definitely distracting her from her homework...)
text @[Tomoya]
text (But today is the day that all my hard work was finally recognized...)
text @[Tomoya]
text (So it should be okay...)
text The parts of my body touching hers start to feel stuffy from all of the heat.
text But I still don't let go.
